sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS implementation supports the optional SummaryInventory report

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to retrieve a SummaryInventory report
    CSMS->>CS: GetBaseReportRequest (requestId, reportBase = SummaryInventory)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestId has integer value >= 0<br>reportBase = SummaryInventory

    CS-->>CSMS: GetBaseReportResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: CSMS receives all NotifyReportRequest messages for this requestId<br>and is able to show the result of the summary inventory to an operator
